Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=22}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 5,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro... Why are you\Nstanding like that?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna be a statue,\NI prefer this pose.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:57.47,0:01:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no time\Nto be playing around!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:00.40,0:02:01.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could at least
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.48,0:02:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,do something about\Nall this blood?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:03.14,0:02:04.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm getting nauseous\Njust looking at it.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NSo quit lookin' at it, then.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's kind of hard to ignore.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:08.11,0:02:09.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you still think\Nit was a bright idea
Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to cut your own legs off so\Nthat we could escape from here?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:12.55,0:02:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThat wasn't the point.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was going to cut them off\Nso that we could fight.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.55,0:02:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, was that the plan?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:17.63,0:02:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause that's an\Neven worse idea!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.83,0:02:21.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.27,0:02:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously, sometimes\NI think you were born
Dialogue: 5,0:02:23.65,0:02:26.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,without any common\Nsense at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:26.30,0:02:29.07,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NWe're stuck here about\Nto be turned into wax statues,
Dialogue: 5,0:02:29.07,0:02:30.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,and the two of\Nthem are bickering!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.93,0:02:32.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They really don't seem\Nto understand the danger
Dialogue: 5,0:02:32.93,0:02:35.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,of the situation at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.97,0:02:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, sword guy...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that all the fight\Nyou got left in ya?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:41.82,0:02:43.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm gonna\Nhave to let someone else
Dialogue: 5,0:02:44.61,0:02:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,take over from here.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.38,0:02:49.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't seem terribly worried
Dialogue: 5,0:02:49.93,0:02:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about what's going to happen\Nto them, Mr. 3.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NAnd you don't\Nseem terribly worried
Dialogue: 5,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about making sure it happens,\NMiss Golden Week.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NSolidify already...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wanna die\Nin a cool pose, Nami,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.92,0:03:01.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'd better hurry up.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:01.99,0:03:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bushido, could you\Nplease take this
Dialogue: 5,0:03:03.51,0:03:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a little more seriously?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:05.02,0:03:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, your pose could use\Na little work, too.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.09,0:03:09.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shut up about\Nthe posing already!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.89,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're acting so\Ncareless like this
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.93,0:03:12.83,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}for no other reason\Nthan to mock us!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is very annoying!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:16.05,0:03:17.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.46,0:03:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NThough he doesn't seem to be
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.67,0:03:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a very reliable man...\NIf you ask me.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.16,0:03:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5]\NMr. 5.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NHm?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.57,0:03:26.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be happy to take care\Nof the Straw Hat pest.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.23,0:03:29.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NHmph. Take care of him?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please. Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.68,0:03:33.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sent you to take care\Nof him once already,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.51,0:03:35.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and look! He's standing in\Nfront of us alive and well,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.95,0:03:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,interfering with my\Nartistic process.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's clear that\Nyou can't handle him.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's obviously too much\Nfor you, wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.33,0:03:45.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.08,0:03:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You two can deal\Nwith the others.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.48,0:03:49.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you think you're\Nup to it, that is.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.01,0:03:50.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think a Straw Hat Luffy\Nstatue would make
Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.48,0:03:54.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,an excellent addition\Nto my collection.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.98,0:03:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I've had way\Nmore than enough of you.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.95,0:04:03.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And if you cretins know\Nwhat's good for ya,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll give up now.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.76,0:04:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay, we're safely\Nin position now.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got your back\Nfrom here, Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.22,0:04:16.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHm? Did you say something?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.86,0:04:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MR. 3]\NNow I've\Ngot you! Candle... Lock!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.39,0:04:23.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelping]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.37,0:04:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.87,0:04:28.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.62,0:04:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDamn! He got caught already?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.94,0:04:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NMoron!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.11,0:04:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.27,0:04:37.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is,\Nit's nice and heavy.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:37.21,0:04:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NAlmost too simple...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.95,0:04:43.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, just once more.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.55,0:04:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHm...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:46.85,0:04:49.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This should be perfect!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.02,0:04:51.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Candle... Lock!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.12,0:04:51.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.89,0:04:53.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.97,0:05:00.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, giant guy!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.80,0:05:03.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.71,0:05:05.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... What the...?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.14,0:05:07.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this weirdo doing now?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:15.82,0:05:16.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 5,0:05:16.62,0:05:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.95,0:05:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mallet!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.73,0:05:24.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.93,0:05:26.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[VIVI, NAMI]\N– All right!\N– All right!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI, NAMI, ZORO scream]
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.63,0:05:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, VIVI screaming]
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.77,0:05:41.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI, ZORO, NAMI whimpering]
Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, the thing on my legs\Nbroke at the same time.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.36,0:05:51.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUm, but wait...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.51,0:05:54.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are they still there?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.45,0:05:57.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.82,0:05:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're okay now.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.19,0:06:02.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't die.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:02.92,0:06:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're still alive
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.76,0:06:06.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but that really\Ndidn't help at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.17,0:06:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was a close one!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why didn't\Nyou guys run away?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.41,0:06:10.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[VIVI, NAMI]\N– Because we're stuck here!\N– Because we're stuck here!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.81,0:06:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that obvious?!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.04,0:06:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's what's going on?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.71,0:06:16.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing\Nyou guys kept saying
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was that I needed to\Nbreak the pillar...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.88,0:06:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bushido!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.88,0:06:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think it's\Na good idea to put our lives
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.67,0:06:22.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in that guy's hands?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we don't exactly have\Nmuch of a choice, do we?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I'm having a little bit\Nof trouble moving right now...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... can't move...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.14,0:06:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,647)}What's happening?\NMy body... I don't know...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.64,0:06:43.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It... It won't move...\NI can't move at all...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.43,0:06:43.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Mr. 3 cackles]
Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NYou fools!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NYou fools!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All you did was move\Nthe candles closer!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:51.99,0:06:55.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And by doing so, you only sped\Nup the solidifying process.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll become wax figures\Neven sooner, now!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.63,0:06:59.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.20,0:07:01.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh! That guy!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna punch him,\Nright in his smug little face!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.70,0:07:04.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWait! You guys are\Ngonna turn into wax figures?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.99,0:07:10.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThat's what we've\Nbeen trying to tell you!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.24,0:07:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NPlease just hurry up\Nand destroy this thing, Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRight, yeah, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.68,0:07:16.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NI don't think so, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, get out of my way!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Wax-Wax... Harpoon!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.65,0:07:21.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.36,0:07:30.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5 gulps]
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.29,0:07:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yelps]
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.08,0:07:47.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not very flavorful.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your gunpowder must\Nnot be too good.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.29,0:07:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way! He ate it!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.36,0:07:54.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.13,0:07:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThis isn't really\Nlooking good for us, ladies...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This damn thing is speeding up.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.08,0:08:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good thing I've\Ngot my pose ready.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.05,0:08:03.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.82,0:08:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy!\NYou have to hurry!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! So the pumpkin\Nthing has to go.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.16,0:08:13.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}I'm on it now! Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:13.23,0:08:16.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MR. 3]\NIt's no use! Candle... Wall!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.11,0:08:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bazooka!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Outta my way!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking\Nthe same thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:27.65,0:08:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would greatly appreciate it\Nif you would quit interfering
Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.41,0:08:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}with my creative\Nactivities. Candle Lock!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a mallet...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.47,0:08:41.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}No you don't! Candle Wall!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NMallet!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:54.97,0:08:56.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3 whimpers]
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.14,0:08:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3 screams]
Dialogue: 5,0:09:04.15,0:09:05.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}M-Mr. 3?!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.25,0:09:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No way!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLuffy! Hurry up\Nand break this thing
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.40,0:09:12.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before we die up here!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.25,0:09:13.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, no...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:13.25,0:09:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit joking around and hurry.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.78,0:09:16.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNuh-uh.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:16.58,0:09:18.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]\NQuit being an idiot!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now's not really a good time!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NLuffy! Please just do it!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not now... I...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.29,0:09:27.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...just don't feel\Nlike saving you.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.16,0:09:30.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[pants]
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.52,0:09:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.83,0:09:36.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}My Colors Trap.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.02,0:09:40.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.37,0:09:42.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no time\Nto space out now!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do somethin' about this already!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.01,0:09:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah... I know.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.51,0:09:47.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NThen quit just\Nstanding there, will you?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.41,0:09:49.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NCome on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.95,0:09:51.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know what I should do.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.45,0:09:54.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... I don't feel like it...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.37,0:09:56.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Why do you\Nkeep saying that?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're about to be\Nturned into wax statues!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?\NWe're going to die!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:00.83,0:10:01.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.96,0:10:05.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, I can't\Nget motivated to help...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– What do you mean, "can't get motivated"?!\N– What do you mean, "can't get motivated"?!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.81,0:10:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?\NWhat is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our friends are gonna\Ndie if he doesn't
Dialogue: 5,0:10:15.18,0:10:17.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,do something to help them soon.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll snap him out of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.86,0:10:25.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhere did you two come from?!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your friend has already\Nfallen into a nasty trap.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.93,0:10:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed\Nwhat he's standing on?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Standing?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:37.91,0:10:39.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLet me take a look.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.26,0:10:40.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhat's that? There's a strange
Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.84,0:10:42.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,black pattern on the ground.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.76,0:10:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's so important\Nabout that thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.83,0:10:46.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.73,0:10:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really don't get it\Nat all, do you?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's funny?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.57,0:10:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Paint... That's what's funny.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just paint...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:58.40,0:11:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You and your friends don't\Nstand a chance of escapin' now.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.11,0:11:04.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.94,0:11:07.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screaming]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.40,0:11:13.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.04,0:11:13.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO screaming]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.61,0:11:16.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo! Let's make a run for it!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.51,0:11:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, now\Nthey're running away.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.83,0:11:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lets get 'em.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead, Karoo!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.30,0:11:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! I'm not on yet!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Slow down, Karoo! Let me on!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.86,0:11:37.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, bird, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.20,0:11:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me on!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:37.90,0:11:39.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.53,0:11:42.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just let me on, now!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.20,0:11:47.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP panting]
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.34,0:11:48.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhy are you afraid of me?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.57,0:11:50.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you were\Na duck, not a chicken!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.35,0:11:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Slow down, will you?!\NPlease, Karoo!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.95,0:11:59.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Golden Week's responsible!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.24,0:12:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that this is your doing!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.03,0:12:04.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's my Colors Trap.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.40,0:12:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Betrayal Black.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.57,0:12:07.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you touch the paint,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll want to\Nbetray your friends,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.10,0:12:11.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,no matter what they might say.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.01,0:12:13.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if they beg\Nand plead for help.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.74,0:12:15.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.11,0:12:17.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Nwhat's going on here.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.25,0:12:18.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's a painter.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She uses her paint to\Ncreate different emotions.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.45,0:12:22.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Each color is a feeling.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Her sense of\Ncolor's so complete,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,she can manipulate your mind.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.62,0:12:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just a splash of\None of her colors,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you'll be\Nunder her control.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.70,0:12:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Under her control?!\NWell, that's not good.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.67,0:12:36.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That simpleminded oaf is\Nalready too easy to control.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.43,0:12:39.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need is\Nsomeone messing with his mind.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.17,0:12:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that all\Nhe needs to do is get away
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.20,0:12:43.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the paint\Nand he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.17,0:12:45.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Move away\Nfrom there, quickly!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.55,0:12:47.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NNo, don't! Luffy, listen!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do,\Nplease don't step outside
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.71,0:12:52.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the black circle,\Nall right? I'm begging!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.12,0:12:56.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat are you saying?!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.09,0:12:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NWe don't want\Nyou to save us, Luffy.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.43,0:13:00.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, stay away from us!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.23,0:13:05.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI get it now.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.47,0:13:07.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just needed to say\Nthe exact opposite
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.60,0:13:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of what we wanted him to do.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.07,0:13:11.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:12.51,0:13:15.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... What just happened?\NI was acting really strange.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VIVI]\NLuffy! Help us now!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:23.46,0:13:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOkay! I'm on my way right now!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.36,0:13:28.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never mind. I just\Nwanna laugh right now!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.84,0:13:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.84,0:13:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.01,0:13:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What now?!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Colors Trap again.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.02,0:13:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Laughter Yellow.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.25,0:13:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[laughing]
Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should not have\Nstepped out of the circle.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.58,0:13:47.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.73,0:13:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's on his clothing!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Quick!\NTake off your shirt.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'd love to, really.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.33,0:13:56.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But right now,\NI'm too busy laughing.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.46,0:14:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]\NIt's getting bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the wax keeps\Nfalling at this rate,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll be lucky to stay\Nalive for five mintues.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, KAROO screaming]
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.63,0:14:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, KAROO screaming]
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.12,0:14:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NDid you guys come\Nhere just to play tag?!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.74,0:14:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, KAROO scream]
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NLook! When Usopp ran into Luffy,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the paint smudged!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY panting]
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.71,0:14:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NJeez! What's going on?!\NI felt all weird again!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.23,0:14:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, painter girl!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.55,0:14:36.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you stop messin'\Nwith me already?!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.55,0:14:38.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NBut you\Nwere having such a good time.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.39,0:14:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it funny?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...\Nit was kinda funny.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.67,0:14:43.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But stop!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.56,0:14:46.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've gotta see about\Nbreaking that pumpkin now.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,350)}[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NAnother Colors Trap!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.50,0:14:51.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time for Bullfight Red!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.91,0:14:54.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NBazooka!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.84,0:14:56.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat were you aiming at?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just can't let you break it.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.92,0:15:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 3 wouldn't be\Nhappy about that at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.05,0:15:01.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you do?!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.65,0:15:02.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,During a bull fight,\Na bull can't
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.91,0:15:04.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,control his urge to\Nattack the red cape.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.95,0:15:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Likewise, you can't\Ndo anything now
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.74,0:15:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but attack that red circle.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I did.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.76,0:15:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.57,0:15:12.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay, that does it!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.26,0:15:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm mad now!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.21,0:15:15.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.37,0:15:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bazooka!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Having fun?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.81,0:15:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw... Oh, great...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.15,0:15:25.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's never\Ngonna be able to beat her.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.68,0:15:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now all of his\Nstrength is useless.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NNow to finish up!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.25,0:15:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll mix the Laughter\NYellow on your back
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.17,0:15:33.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with some Sadness Blue!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.35,0:15:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The last Colors Trap:\NTranquil Green.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.40,0:15:40.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.34,0:15:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah... That's some good tea!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.34,0:15:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI, ZORO, VIVI]\N– Luffy!\N– Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.88,0:15:50.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... What happens now?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.22,0:15:51.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, I told you,\Nyou should have posed,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you wouldn't listen to me.\NAnd now it's too late.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.86,0:15:55.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.36,0:15:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you really still\Ntalking about that?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.47,0:16:12.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn. How can they just\Nkeep runnin' like that?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nose Fancy Double Cannon!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.27,0:16:23.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.37,0:16:27.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]\NYou missed us,\Njerk! Way to go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.17,0:16:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My turn now!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.45,0:16:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack: Lead Star!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.33,0:16:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe need to get back\Nto Luffy and the others now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chasin' them around\Nisn't gettin us anywhere.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I noticed.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.19,0:16:52.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hate to use this on\Nuseless pests like them,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it looks like we may\Nnot have a choice now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.95,0:16:57.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This little beauty\Nshould be quite handy.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.92,0:17:00.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A .44-caliber, six-shot,\Nflintlock revolver.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.99,0:17:04.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a new model out\Nof the South Blue.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.10,0:17:06.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Continuous fire.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:06.10,0:17:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And when I shoot it,\Nthe bullets are invisible.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhen Luffy was acting\Nso strange back there,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,those two agents mentioned\Nsomething about paint.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:15.05,0:17:18.02,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The paint must have something\Nto do with Luffy's behavior!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.02,0:17:19.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There was also some\Nyellow paint on his back
Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.79,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,when we crashed\Ninto him earlier.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:21.79,0:17:23.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the key!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.26,0:17:25.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We just have to do\Nsomething about the paint
Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.56,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,before it's too late!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.56,0:17:27.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHurry!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO squawks]
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.55,0:17:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sighs]\NThis really is some nice tea.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:49.69,0:17:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.63,0:17:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wake up!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.03,0:18:01.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nice tea...\NSo nice... Very nice.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.06,0:18:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting there...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...and drinking tea?!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run all you want. It's all over\Nfor you and your friends.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.92,0:18:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here comes my best trick so far!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.66,0:18:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack: Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.39,0:18:22.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH SCREAM]
Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.59,0:18:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS VALENTINE]\NAhaha
Dialogue: 5,0:18:27.46,0:18:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an idiot!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.53,0:18:31.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He missed the target\Nand hit his friend instead.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.20,0:18:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good. That was the\Nlast of his bullets.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.07,0:18:41.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MR. 5 chuckles]\NBreeze Breath Bomb!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.31,0:18:44.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH scream]
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.49,0:18:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention that\Nmy breath is also explosive?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:50.41,0:18:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NDamn. I can't believe this guy!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.15,0:18:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He didn't have any\Nbullets to begin with?!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:55.48,0:18:58.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Karoo... Are you all right?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.28,0:19:00.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO groans]
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughs]\NLuffy...!\NYou snap out of it yet?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah. I'm good now, thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NSo he didn't miss!\NHis plan this whole time
Dialogue: 5,0:19:09.47,0:19:12.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was to burn the Colors Trap\Non the Straw Hat's shirt.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.14,0:19:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[pants]
Dialogue: 5,0:19:13.60,0:19:16.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your stupid paints.\NYou're through...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.36,0:19:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you hurt\Nany more of my friends...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.31,0:19:23.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls]\NNow, I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.64,0:19:29.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird.\NIt's been a long time,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.54,0:19:33.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and no one's come back.\NI wonder what's going on.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.65,0:19:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This island's crazy.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.88,0:19:38.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything could have happened\Nto Nami, Vivi, and the others,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.29,0:19:39.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which means that\Ncooking this lizard
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.82,0:19:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,may have to wait for a while.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.72,0:19:48.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Vivi!\NCan you hear me?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.33,0:19:50.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Beautiful ladies!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.33,0:19:52.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me,\Nplease just say something!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's strange. What's this?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.01,0:20:04.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5 laughs]\NOh, you're mad, are ya?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.12,0:20:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at your friends. Being\Nmad won't do them any good.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it will!\NThey're still alive!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.32,0:20:14.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5 laughs]\NAre they, now? Look again...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.13,0:20:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All they need is some of\NMiss Golden Week's paint,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.19,0:20:18.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they'll be\Nperfect wax statues.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Face it: You're too\Nlate to save them...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.93,0:20:23.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gone, and you know it!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.13,0:20:24.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROWLS]
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.20,0:20:26.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NMr. 5 is right about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your friends are finished\Nbecause you were too late
Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.80,0:20:32.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to help them, and now,\Nit's your turn to die.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.22,0:20:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NIt's time for...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.99,0:20:52.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MR. 3]\N...Candle...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.66,0:20:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Champion!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.10,0:20:58.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3 laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.36,0:21:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.46,0:21:03.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:03.13,0:21:05.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That thing...? That is\Nwhat he used one time
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.50,0:21:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to take down someone with a\Nforty-two million berry bounty.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.80,0:21:11.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's Mr. 3's most\Ndangerous work of art.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to use your talents,\NMiss Golden Week.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.44,0:21:16.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need an extra special\Npaint job for my armor,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:16.24,0:21:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and don't forget to be artistic.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:18.05,0:21:19.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After that, can I take a break?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.89,0:21:21.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NWhy, yes,\Nyou can go get some tea.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.98,0:21:24.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer it if you stayed\Nout of this, actually.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.15,0:21:27.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I'm in this armor,\NI'm utterly impervious to harm.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:27.32,0:21:28.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This suit is as hard as iron.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.63,0:21:30.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It may be made of wax,\Nbut it fits like a glove,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and it's impossible\Nfor anyone to pierce.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.17,0:21:35.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you don't stand\Na chance against it.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NThis artwork is flawless.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.58,0:21:45.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow...! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.42,0:21:48.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you\Nadmiring him?! Fight!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:49.19,0:21:51.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just a little more\Nlaughter yellow...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.69,0:21:55.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Right! Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:57.17,0:21:58.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NPaint job complete!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.27,0:21:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.97,0:22:01.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\N...Pistol!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.41,0:22:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Champion Fight:\NHarvest Field Maneuver.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.35,0:22:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:13.22,0:22:14.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\N...Stamp!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:19.04,0:22:20.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hehe! Nice try!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.25,0:22:21.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.38,0:22:24.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy's attacks don't work\Nagainst that guy's armor!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:28.39,0:22:32.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughs]\NThe wax is choking me! Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:34.49,0:22:35.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wax... Huh...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.51,0:22:43.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOf course...! Why didn't\NI realize it before now?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.23,0:22:44.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all wax,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:44.92,0:22:47.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which means that\Nit must be able to melt!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:48.23,0:22:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLuffy, we need to use fire!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard it is,\Nwax is still wax!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.70,0:22:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The others only hardened\Na few moments ago...!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.61,0:22:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should still be\Nable to save them!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.37,0:22:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quack!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.24,0:23:00.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:00.95,0:23:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS GOLDEN WEEK]\NYeah, that's correct.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.88,0:23:05.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah! You idiot!\NDon't tell them that!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.65,0:23:08.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't really matter\Nif you realize that now,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:08.12,0:23:09.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you have no\Nhope of saving them.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.79,0:23:11.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have thirty\Nseconds left, at most.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:11.56,0:23:14.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After that, their hearts\Nwill slow to a stop.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.19,0:23:16.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As we speak, they're\Nwrithing in silent pain,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,barely conscious...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:17.15,0:23:19.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're hanging onto\Ntheir lives by a thread,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.29,0:23:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,terrified of\Ntheir impending doom
Dialogue: 5,0:23:20.99,0:23:22.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and unable to move or\Neven scream for help...!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:22.99,0:23:28.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And they know that you were too\Nlate to save them! Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:28.03,0:23:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}I'll save 'em right now.\NI don't need thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:32.70,0:23:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Breeze Breath Bomb!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:36.14,0:23:38.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.04,0:23:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! No!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.21,0:23:44.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quaaaack!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:44.05,0:23:45.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When we say you\Ndon't stand a chance,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.88,0:23:46.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it's best to believe us.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.63,0:23:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 5,0:23:50.63,0:23:52.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDamn it!\NWe're running out of time!
Dialogue: 5,0:23:54.62,0:23:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NJust give up.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.97,0:24:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, I need you to grab\Na hold of this rope, Karoo.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:05.91,0:24:08.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS VALENTINE]\NWell, this looks like a party.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:08.48,0:24:10.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now what are\Nyou two planning...?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:10.45,0:24:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could\Njoin in on the fun?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.85,0:24:18.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo, run now.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:18.25,0:24:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:19.82,0:24:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NJust run around\Nall the candle sticks!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:21.26,0:24:23.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And move as quick as you can!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.99,0:24:28.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on.\NI don't know why you bother.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:28.68,0:24:29.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MISS VALENTINE]\N'Scuse me.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:29.55,0:24:30.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:30.61,0:24:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MISS VALENTINE]\NCan you\Nhandle my Crescendo Stone?
Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.74,0:24:37.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder just how many kilograms\Nyou'll be able to endure.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:37.99,0:24:40.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO]\NQuaaaaack! Quack!
Dialogue: 5,0:24:40.16,0:24:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MISS VALENTINE]\NTen kilograms.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:41.43,0:24:43.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP groans]
Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MISS VALENTINE]\NOne hundred kilograms.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:44.60,0:24:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP groans]
Dialogue: 5,0:24:48.15,0:24:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MISS VALENTINE]\NTwo hundred kilograms.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:50.28,0:24:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 5,0:24:51.26,0:24:53.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[MISS VALENTINE]\NThree hundred kilograms.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:53.37,0:24:55.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 5,0:24:56.81,0:25:00.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5]\NDamn it!\NHold still, you quacker!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:00.31,0:25:04.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahaha! Give it up! It's no use!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:04.28,0:25:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your friends are a permanent\Npart of my collection now!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Accept it. Hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:09.57,0:25:11.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're not!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:11.47,0:25:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna let\Nyou have my friends, candle boy!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:14.75,0:25:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have any fire,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:15.81,0:25:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I'm gonna have\Nto borrow yours.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:16.98,0:25:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope that's okay!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:18.44,0:25:20.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That hurts! Quit pulling!\NStop it!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:20.98,0:25:22.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:22.14,0:25:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That tiny little flame isn't\Ngonna work quickly enough!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:24.45,0:25:26.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThe rope that Karoo has...
Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.08,0:25:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Light that on fire!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:27.75,0:25:29.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A rope? How's that\Nsupposed to help us?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:29.90,0:25:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just trust me on this!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:31.96,0:25:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 5,0:25:32.98,0:25:35.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I covered the\Nwhole thing in oil.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:35.49,0:25:38.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOkay, everyone,\Nit's time to wake up!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:38.09,0:25:39.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be hot,\Nbut it's the only way,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:39.84,0:25:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they should be all right.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:41.46,0:25:43.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let go! Aaaaaa!
Dialogue: 5,0:25:44.46,0:25:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY roars]
Dialogue: 5,0:25:57.61,0:26:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah! Ahhh
Dialogue: 5,0:26:01.14,0:26:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, whoops...!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:02.81,0:26:05.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hope the others don't\Nget all burned up!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:06.05,0:26:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NOh, curse you, you\Nstupid Straw Hat pirate!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:09.62,0:26:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You destroyed\Nmy precious candle set...!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:12.02,0:26:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you show such disregard\Nfor artistic integrity!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:17.13,0:26:18.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NYou'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:19.96,0:26:21.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You're not getting\Naway with this...
Dialogue: 5,0:26:21.96,0:26:24.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quaaaaack! Quaaaaack!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:24.82,0:26:25.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5]\NDamn it...
Dialogue: 5,0:26:26.42,0:26:29.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock\NBaroque Works agents?!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:30.58,0:26:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of you\Nand your friends! Got that?
Dialogue: 5,0:26:34.91,0:26:36.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, playtime\Nis really over now!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:37.68,0:26:39.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to break\Nthat scrawny little neck
Dialogue: 5,0:26:39.23,0:26:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of yours into a million pieces!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.82,0:26:42.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ten Thousand...
Dialogue: 5,0:26:42.93,0:26:44.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kilogram Guillotine!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:55.09,0:26:55.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThat was really hot!
Dialogue: 5,0:26:55.99,0:26:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have\Nthought up another plan?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:02.43,0:27:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're being a little\Npicky here, don't you think?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:04.33,0:27:06.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't you at least\Na little bit grateful...?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have a point there. Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:08.94,0:27:11.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's amazing! I can't\Nbelieve we're actually alive!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:11.81,0:27:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got out of the wax, did ya?\NWell, I've had enough...
Dialogue: 5,0:27:15.66,0:27:20.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We simply cannot afford for you\Nto screw up our mission anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:20.74,0:27:22.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHey, Mr. 5!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:22.75,0:27:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack...\NExploding Star!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:26.65,0:27:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool!\NHaven't you figured out
Dialogue: 5,0:27:27.76,0:27:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that your pathetic explosives\Ndon't affect me at all?
Dialogue: 5,0:27:30.59,0:27:32.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're nothing to\Nan exploding man!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:32.66,0:27:34.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You took the bait!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:36.79,0:27:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NI just told a little lie.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That wasn't an Exploding Star...
Dialogue: 5,0:27:40.69,0:27:43.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was a Special Tabasco Star.
Dialogue: 5,0:27:43.68,0:27:46.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5]\NSpicy
Dialogue: 5,0:27:46.85,0:27:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haha
Dialogue: 5,0:27:49.62,0:27:53.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had to learn how effective\Nthat thing was the hard way!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:53.09,0:27:54.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5 grunts]
Dialogue: 5,0:27:54.42,0:27:56.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn, you stupid pirate!
Dialogue: 5,0:27:56.39,0:27:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:27:57.72,0:27:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 5,0:27:58.59,0:28:00.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5]\NTime for a full body explosion!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:00.89,0:28:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There'll be nothing\Nleft of you.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:03.10,0:28:04.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOw...\NOw, let go of me!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:04.73,0:28:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!\NPlease let go!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:08.00,0:28:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(2564,0,1,\c&H0A0805&\3c&H0A0805&\4c&H0A0805&)}I'm too young to die...\NI'm too young to die...
Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.00,0:28:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Let go!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:18.01,0:28:20.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO]\NFlaming Oni Giri...
Dialogue: 5,0:28:20.83,0:28:22.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5]\NHuh
Dialogue: 5,0:28:22.60,0:28:23.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 5,0:28:23.63,0:28:24.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 5,0:28:24.63,0:28:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 5 SCREAMS]
Dialogue: 5,0:28:38.93,0:28:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou know these\Nflaming swords aren't too bad.
Dialogue: 5,0:28:48.00,0:28:49.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NZoro!
Dialogue: 5,0:28:52.35,0:28:54.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BROGY grunts]
Dialogue: 5,0:29:00.07,0:29:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, there. Glad to see\Nyou made it out alive.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:01.87,0:29:03.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:13.40,0:29:14.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 5,0:29:14.82,0:29:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So now it seems...\Ntwo foes are left.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:21.86,0:29:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NBird guy! Lets go
Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.75,0:29:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAROO]\NQuack! Quack!
Dialogue: 5,0:29:24.49,0:29:26.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They won't get off so easy!
Dialogue: 5,0:29:27.50,0:29:29.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Real men don't interfere\Nwith someone else's fight!
Dialogue: 5,0:29:32.52,0:29:33.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3 LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 5,0:29:36.73,0:29:40.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NSo good of you to\Ncome, I've been expecting you...
Dialogue: 5,0:29:40.70,0:29:43.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my Wax-Wax Manor.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:43.31,0:29:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 5,0:29:44.91,0:29:47.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NWhy, just a little\Ngame of hide and seek...
Dialogue: 5,0:29:47.71,0:29:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you figure out\Nwhich one is me?
Dialogue: 5,0:29:49.58,0:29:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:29:51.99,0:29:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd say it appears you picked\Nthe wrong group of people
Dialogue: 5,0:29:54.66,0:29:55.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to go up against.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:55.96,0:29:58.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're no match for\Nmy intellectual prowess
Dialogue: 5,0:29:58.38,0:29:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and artistic abilities.
Dialogue: 5,0:29:59.55,0:30:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just another buffoon\Nwho acts on blind instinct
Dialogue: 5,0:30:02.89,0:30:05.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and uses brute force to\Nsolve all his problems.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:05.91,0:30:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't hope to catch an\Nintellectual giant like me!
Dialogue: 5,0:30:09.14,0:30:11.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:30:11.98,0:30:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am a Baroque Works agent.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:14.75,0:30:18.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every assignment that is given\Nto me I see through to its end.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:18.82,0:30:21.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So if you think you're ready,\Nthen just step forward.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:21.82,0:30:28.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:30:28.73,0:30:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right;\Njust take a little step.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:31.27,0:30:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And as soon as\Nyour back is turned,
Dialogue: 5,0:30:34.12,0:30:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stab you...
Dialogue: 5,0:30:35.97,0:30:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:30:38.97,0:30:41.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...right through that\Npathetically noble
Dialogue: 5,0:30:41.43,0:30:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,little heart of yours.
Dialogue: 5,0:30:43.01,0:30:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 5,0:30:50.04,0:30:54.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum... Stamp
Dialogue: 5,0:30:58.11,0:30:59.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NAhh
Dialogue: 5,0:30:59.31,0:31:00.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 5,0:31:00.34,0:31:01.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MR. 3]\NHow could you have known...
Dialogue: 5,0:31:04.74,0:31:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that... this...\Nis where I was...?
Dialogue: 5,0:31:06.65,0:31:09.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 5,0:31:12.64,0:31:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Instinct.
Dialogue: 5,0:31:14.46,0:31:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHRIEKS]
Dialogue: 5,0:31:21.26,0:31:28.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CLINKING GLASS]
Dialogue: 5,0:31:34.92,0:31:41.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNIFFS]
Dialogue: 5,0:31:41.42,0:31:45.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NEarl Grey is a perfect\Naddition to the afternoon
Dialogue: 5,0:31:45.29,0:31:48.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaah! Hold on!\NWhat am I doing...?!
Dialogue: 5,0:31:48.09,0:31:50.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be sitting here\Nall relaxed just casually
Dialogue: 5,0:31:50.19,0:31:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,sipping tea without a\Nsingle care in the world!
Dialogue: 5,0:31:52.69,0:31:55.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, Vivi, and the others\Ncould be waiting out there
Dialogue: 5,0:31:55.20,0:31:58.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,right now for me\Nto come and help them!
Dialogue: 5,0:31:58.33,0:32:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am still curious about\None thing, though...
Dialogue: 5,0:32:01.04,0:32:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is a nice,\Nrelaxing place like this
Dialogue: 5,0:32:03.04,0:32:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,doing smack in the middle\Nof an ancient, creepy jungle?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:06.04,0:32:09.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAIL ringing]
Dialogue: 5,0:32:09.04,0:32:11.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:11.21,0:32:16.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SNAIL ringing]
Dialogue: 5,0:32:16.30,0:32:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:26.67,0:32:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A transponder snail.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:32.21,0:32:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hello...
Dialogue: 5,0:32:33.98,0:32:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've reached the crap café...
Dialogue: 5,0:32:36.05,0:32:37.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can I take your order...?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:41.66,0:32:47.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can quit fooling\Naround now, jackass.
Dialogue: 5,0:32:47.59,0:32:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 5,0:32:48.60,0:32:52.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your report's a little bit late,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:52.07,0:32:55.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHuh...? My report, you say?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:55.17,0:32:59.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And to whom exactly\Nam I speaking, please?
Dialogue: 5,0:32:59.41,0:33:00.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 5,0:33:00.42,0:33:02.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 0.
Dialogue: 5,0:33:03.79,0:33:05.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHmm...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=23}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=24}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
